">Naturalist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Экзотика Нетера</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neutrino\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neutrino</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ottercraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ottercraft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/petrock-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Petrock - Forge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/restored-earth\" rel=\"nofollow\">Restored Earth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snuffles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Snuffles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sprout\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sprout</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stalwart Dungeons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/steves-vanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Steve's Vanilla</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/strawgolem-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Straw Golem Reborn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unvoted-shelved\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unvoted &amp; Shelved</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/whisperwoods\" rel=\"nofollow\">Whisperwoods</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-wild-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wild Update Mod</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ydms-allay\" rel=\"nofollow\">YDM's Allay</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ydms-coppergolem\" rel=\"nofollow\">YDM's CopperGolem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ydms-glare\" rel=\"nofollow\">YDM's Glare</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>1.16.5</h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-abyss-chapter-ii\" rel=\"nofollow\">Бездна II — Другая сторона</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Мобы Алекса</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animalium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Анималиум</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Аквакультура 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Арс Новео</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Атум 2: Возвращение в пески</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Осень</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betteranimalsplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Лучше животные плюс</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend-forge-port\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend-re-forked\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd переработанный</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterlands\" rel=\"nofollow\">Лучшие земли</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterNether переработанный</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caves-and-cliffs-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Порт Caves & Cliffs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/charm-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">Чарм переработанный</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chococraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChocoCraft<